config BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_INIT
    bool "blackhand-init"
    help
      Custom PID 1 init for Black Hand OS.
      Implement process reaping, mount setup, and service manager spawn.

config BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_INIT_DEBUG_SHELL
    bool "debug shell on tty2 (INSECURE - bring-up only)"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_INIT
    help
      Spawn an UNAUTHENTICATED root shell on /dev/tty2, reachable with
      Alt+F2 (the UI owns tty1). It respawns if you exit it, so it cannot
      be lost mid-session.

      This bypasses the app PIN and every other access control, and is the
      rescue path when SSH is unavailable.

      NEVER enable this in a production image.
